{"id":101,"chapter_id":0,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":2,"content":"……你能记起的只有这些吗……命运真是太残酷了……","voice":["vo_cgplot_101001"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"但，不要紧……只要还记得自己是谁，你就不会失去一切……","voice":["vo_cgplot_101002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"来吧，回到我身边……属于你的战斗已经开始。","voice":["vo_cgplot_101003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"……我……等你……","voice":["vo_cgplot_101004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1}]}